---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Amelia Rowland"
  description="Amelia Rowland is a GIS specialist, cartographer, and graduate student in Geography: Global Change and Sustainability at the University of Vienna."
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-16 pb-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">About</h1>

    <div class="prose-map mt-8">
      <p>
        Hi! I'm Amelia — a consultant, GIS specialist, and software product engineer
        inspired by sustainability, systems thinking, and telling stories with data.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm currently completing a Master's in Geography: Global Change and
        Sustainability at the University of Vienna, specializing in socio-economic
        transformations. This work has deepened my understanding of the complexity
        behind sustainability challenges and the systems-level thinking needed to
        address them. I'm excited to keep contributing and collaborating on work
        related to sustainable urban development.
      </p>

      <h2>Background</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Product Engineer, Esri</strong> — Location Analytics and ArcGIS
          Enterprise.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>GIS Specialist, VHB</strong> — transportation, water resources,
          and environmental regulation projects: interactive web apps, data
          analysis, field maps, and workflow optimization.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>GIS Analyst, Jacobs</strong> — environmental and city planning
          consulting with ArcMap, ArcGIS Pro, ArcGIS Online, and Python.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          MSc Geography: Global Change and Sustainability — University of Vienna
        </li>
        <li>
          BS Geographic Information Science and Cartography, minor in Humanitarian
          Affairs — James Madison University
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Toolbox</h2>
      <p>QGIS · ArcGIS Pro · ArcGIS Online · Python · Data management</p>

      <p>
        Find me on
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ameliarowland09/" target="_blank" rel="noopener me">LinkedIn</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
